
Do, (#DoorCostMethod = "SqFt")|(#DoorCostMethod = "Fixed Cost"):1
{
   ,*************************************************** Individual Door Pricing set to use #PriceMethodDoors from above *****************************************************************
   ,**
   
   DisplaySet,#ShowDoorCost =Yes,         --------   Show detailed door cost for all door styles [No;Yes]
   ,**
   Do, (#ShowDoorCost="Yes")|(#DisplayEdit):1
   {
      
      ,***************** By placing #Pricing Doors below (with no space between PricingDoors) in the door cost lines KCD will use the price method selected above (Sqft or fixed) with the value set in Section 2 of AA-USER.pcb
      ,***************** If you wish to use a different formula or cost method you can. Just select doors below and type a value or use #Variables in combination.
      , Common variables to use are: DoorArea = Sqft of door and DoorDrawerStyleCostGroup = cost of door set in AA-User file under Door Setup
      ,**
      ,**
,Update V7.2.12 start
,Update V8.0 start
      ,**     Each Door and Drawer Front is priced by multiplying its Area by the Cost Per SqFt plus a Fixed Cost. (Each style may be priced differently)
